---
import { Picture } from "astro:assets";
import foundersImage from "../assets/images/family-1.webp";
import cattleImage from "../assets/images/1.webp";
---

<section class="bg-cream py-16 lg:py-24">
    <div class="mx-auto grid max-w-6xl items-center gap-12 px-6 lg:grid-cols-[1.05fr_0.95fr] lg:gap-20">
        <div class="grid grid-cols-[1.2fr_0.8fr] items-end gap-4">
            <Picture
                src={foundersImage}
                alt="Daniel and Tahlia Ferguson with their Murray Grey cattle"
                class="aspect-[4/5] w-full object-cover"
                widths={[420, 650, 850]}
                sizes="(max-width: 1024px) 65vw, 33vw"
                formats={["avif"]}
                fallbackFormat="webp"
                loading="lazy"
                decoding="async"
            />
            <Picture
                src={cattleImage}
                alt="Daniel Ferguson with one of the Ferguson Livestock Murray Grey cattle"
                class="mb-8 aspect-[3/4] w-full object-cover"
                widths={[280, 420, 600]}
                sizes="(max-width: 1024px) 35vw, 22vw"
                formats={["avif"]}
                fallbackFormat="webp"
                loading="lazy"
                decoding="async"
            />
        </div>

        <div>
            <p class="mb-4 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-sage">Meet your farmers</p>
            <h2 class="mb-6 font-display text-4xl font-semibold leading-none text-forest sm:text-5xl lg:text-6xl">Young farmers. Good cattle. A future worth building.</h2>
            <div class="space-y-5 text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-700">
                <p>We’re Daniel and Tahlia Ferguson. We raise Murray Grey cattle on our property in Snake Valley, about 30 minutes from Ballarat.</p>
                <p>Ferguson Livestock is our chance to build something of our own in farming—one herd, one beef drop and one local customer relationship at a time.</p>
                <p>We know the cattle behind every drop, work directly with our local processing partners, and deliver orders ourselves. If you have a question, you talk to us.</p>
            </div>
            <a href="/our-story" class="mt-8 inline-block border-b-2 border-sage pb-1 font-semibold text-forest no-underline transition-colors hover:text-sage">Read Daniel &amp; Tahlia’s story →</a>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>
